'''Ranger [[Krytan armor]]''' is an art type introduced in the Prophecies campaign as [[Ranger collector armor|collector armor]] and is also available for crafting in the Factions campaign.

'''Note:''' Ranger Krytan armor uses a unique mask art in Factions, not available in Prophecies.

There is no [[Prestige armor|prestige]] version of Krytan armor.

